WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.318
This is the story of a little girl named Heidi.

2
00:00:03.319 --> 00:00:06.547
She lived in Switzerland more than one hundred years ago.

3
00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:09.475
Heidi is an orphan.

4
00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.879
When the story begins, she is only five years old.

5
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:17.804
Her aunt takes her to live with her grandfather high up on the mountain.

6
00:00:17.805 --> 00:00:20.959
Lower down the mountain is the town of Dorfli.

7
00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.487
But Grandfather lives alone and never visits the town people.

8
00:00:25.488 --> 00:00:29.115
Heidi loves living on the mountain and quickly makes friends.

9
00:00:29.116 --> 00:00:34.337
There is a young boy, Peter, who looks after the herd of goats every day.

10
00:00:34.338 --> 00:00:39.917
Peter lives with his grandmother a little further down the mountain, but not as far as the town.

11
00:00:39.918 --> 00:00:43.324
Heidi loves to visit Peter’s grandmother.

12
00:00:43.325 --> 00:00:49.311
A day comes, however, when Heidi has to leave the mountain to go live with a sick girl in the city.

13
00:00:49.312 --> 00:00:55.501
She meets a whole new group of people, some are friendly and some are unfriendly.

14
00:00:55.502 --> 00:01:00.306
Miss Rottenmeier, who is in charge of the house, is very disagreeable.

15
00:01:00.307 --> 00:01:06.883
But Clara, the sick girl, becomes Heidi’s friend, and Heidi meets her friendly doctor.

16
00:01:06.884 --> 00:01:12.333
Heidi and Clara have some fun adventures, but Heidi never forgets her home on the mountain.

17
00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:16.739
She misses the flowers, the goats, and all her friends.

18
00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:19.072
Will she ever be able to see them again?

19
00:01:19.073 --> 00:01:24.704
Perhaps the friendly doctor can help . . .

